                            		<div class="awardsTitle">AON Best Employers India 2018 by AON</div>
                            		<div class="awardsDisc">Bajaj Allianz General Insurance Company was conferred with the AON Best Employers India 2018 award at the award ceremony held in Mumbai on 10th May 2018. The award recognized the Company for its culture of employee effectiveness through the Workforce of One approach. About 125 companies from 10 industries representing almost 329,000 employees were scrutinized as part of the Aon&#39;s Best Employers India 2018 study</div>
                            	</div>
                        	</div>
                    	</li>
               		
                    	<li>
                        	<div class="awardsImg"><img src="/content/dam/bagic/aboutus/awards/great-places-to-work-2018.jpg"/></div>
                        	<div class="awardsTitle">Listed among Top 15 BFSI Great Places to Work in India</div>
                        	<div class="awardsDisc">Bajaj Allianz General Insurance has been named in the Top 15 BFSI workplaces, as listed by the prestigious Great Place to Work Institute in India</div>
                        	<div class="awardsBtn"><a class="btn cyberLearnMore">Read more</a></div>
                        	<div class="hiddenAwardsInfo">
                            	<div class="awardsImgInfo"><img src="/content/dam/bagic/aboutus/awards/great-places-to-work-2018.jpg"/></div>
                            	<div class="awardsInfobox">
                            		<div class="awardsTitle">Listed among Top 15 BFSI Great Places to Work in India</div>
                            		<div class="awardsDisc">Bajaj Allianz General Insurance has been named in the Top 15 BFSI workplaces, as listed by the prestigious Great Place to Work Institute in India. The award is a result of a holistic evaluation model comprising of employees&#39; opinion and the strength of employees benefit policies introduced by the management. The critical assessment parameters included employee engagement and happiness along with the attention paid towards employees&#39; professional skilling, learning and development.

</div>
                            	</div>
                        	</div>
                    	</li>
               		
                    	<li>
                        	<div class="awardsImg"><img src="/content/dam/bagic/aboutus/awards/Marketer-of-the-Year2018.png" alt="Award Won By BAGIC"/></div>
                        	<div class="awardsTitle">Marketer of the Year 2018 at 3rd Annual Insurance India Summit &amp; Awards</div>
                        	<div class="awardsDisc">Bajaj Allianz General Insurance has won the Marketer of the Year award at the prestigious 3rd Annual Insurance Industry Summit Awards 2018 on 22nd June 2018.</div>
                        	<div class="awardsBtn"><a class="btn cyberLearnMore">Read more</a></div>
                        	<div class="hiddenAwardsInfo">
                            	<div class="awardsImgInfo"><img src="/content/dam/bagic/aboutus/awards/Marketer-of-the-Year2018.png" alt="Award Won By BAGIC"/></div>
                            	<div class="awardsInfobox">
                            		<div class="awardsTitle">Marketer of the Year 2018 at 3rd Annual Insurance India Summit &amp; Awards</div>
                            		<div class="awardsDisc">Bajaj Allianz General Insurance has won the Marketer of the Year award at the prestigious 3rd Annual Insurance Industry Summit Awards 2018 on 22nd June 2018. The Company received this honour for its augmented reality campaign for My Home plan. Hosted annually, the Insurance Summit &amp; Awards is a prominent industry platform to the decision makers and industry stakeholders. The award was received by Ms. Monica Mayur, Sr. Manager - Brand Management at a glittering award ceremony held in Mumbai.</div>
                            	</div>
                        	</div>
                    	</li>
               		
                    	<li>
                        	<div class="awardsImg"><img src="/content/dam/bagic/aboutus/awards/ceo-of-the-year-2018.png"/></div>
                        	<div class="awardsTitle">CEO of the Year 2018 at 3rd Annual Insurance India Summit &amp; Awards</div>
                        	<div class="awardsDisc">Our MD &amp; CEO, Mr. Tapan Singhel, was adjudged as the CEO of the Year at the prestigious 3rd Annual Insurance Industry Summit Awards 2018 on 22nd June 2018</div>
                        	<div class="awardsBtn"><a class="btn cyberLearnMore">Read more</a></div>
                        	<div class="hiddenAwardsInfo">
                            	<div class="awardsImgInfo"><img src="/content/dam/bagic/aboutus/awards/ceo-of-the-year-2018.png"/></div>
                            	<div class="awardsInfobox">
                            		<div class="awardsTitle">CEO of the Year 2018 at 3rd Annual Insurance India Summit &amp; Awards</div>
                            		<div class="awardsDisc">Our MD &amp; CEO, Mr. Tapan Singhel, was adjudged as the CEO of the Year at the prestigious 3rd Annual Insurance Industry Summit Awards 2018 on 22nd June 2018. The jury judged leaders across the industry on their performance, ethics and values along with the Company&#39;s performance. The award highlights the CEOs who have steered their organizations to the pinnacle of industrial and financial success.

</div>
                            	</div>
                        	</div>
                    	</li>
               		
                    	<li>
                        	<div class="awardsImg"><img src="/content/dam/bagic/aboutus/IDC-Digital-Transformation-2020.jpg"/></div>
                        	<div class="awardsTitle">IDC Digital Transformation Award 2018 for Digital Initiatives</div>
                        	<div class="awardsDisc">Bajaj Allianz General Insurance won the prestigious IDC Digital Transformation Award 2018 for our Artificial Intelligence based chatbot - BOING. </div>
                        	<div class="awardsBtn"><a class="btn cyberLearnMore">Read more</a></div>
                        	<div class="hiddenAwardsInfo">
                            	<div class="awardsImgInfo"><img src="/content/dam/bagic/aboutus/IDC-Digital-Transformation-2020.jpg"/></div>
                            	<div class="awardsInfobox">
                            		<div class="awardsTitle">IDC Digital Transformation Award 2018 for Digital Initiatives</div>
                            		<div class="awardsDisc">Bajaj Allianz General Insurance won the prestigious IDC Digital Transformation Award 2018 for our Artificial Intelligence based chatbot - BOING. The initiative won under the &#39;Digital Transformer&#39; category at the event organized by IDC. The awards honour the achievements of organizations that have successfully planned and executed the digital transformation (DX) of their business through the use of digital and disruptive technologies in Asia/Pacific region. The award was received by Mr Sandipan Chakraborty, Sr. VP, Technology and Mr Ganesh Chopade, AVP, Technology at a gala ceremony on 10th and 11th August 2018 in New Delhi.</div>
                            	</div>
                        	</div>
                    	</li>
               		
                    	<li>
                        	<div class="awardsImg"><img src="/content/dam/bagic/aboutus/awards/operational-excellence-award.jpg"/></div>
                        	<div class="awardsTitle">Operational Excellence Award at Asia Insurance Technology Awards 2018</div>
                        	<div class="awardsDisc">At the Asia Insurance Technology Awards 2018, Bajaj Allianz General Insurance received the Operational Excellence Award for our Tal.Port initiative</div>
                        	<div class="awardsBtn"><a class="btn cyberLearnMore">Read more</a></div>
                        	<div class="hiddenAwardsInfo">
                            	<div class="awardsImgInfo"><img src="/content/dam/bagic/aboutus/awards/operational-excellence-award.jpg"/></div>
                            	<div class="awardsInfobox">
                            		<div class="awardsTitle">Operational Excellence Award at Asia Insurance Technology Awards 2018</div>
                            		<div class="awardsDisc">At the Asia Insurance Technology Awards 2018, Bajaj Allianz General Insurance received the Operational Excellence Award for our Tal.Port initiative. Tal.Port is represented by Eve, our first virtual employee and acts as an end-to-end automated talent acquisition platform. The award was received by Mr Vikramjeet Singh, Chief Human Resource Officer and Mr Saurabh Kapoor, Head Talent Acquisition at the award ceremony held in Singapore.</div>
                            	</div>
                        	</div>
                    	</li>
               		
                    	<li>
                        	<div class="awardsImg"><img src="/content/dam/bagic/aboutus/awards/innovation-emerging-technology-award.jpg"/></div>
                        	<div class="awardsTitle">Innovation &amp; Emerging Technology Award at Asia Insurance Technology Awards 2018</div>
                        	<div class="awardsDisc">Bajaj Allianz General Insurance has won the Innovation &amp; Emerging Technology Award for its Motor On The Spot </div>
                        	<div class="awardsBtn"><a class="btn cyberLearnMore">Read more</a></div>
                        	<div class="hiddenAwardsInfo">
                            	<div class="awardsImgInfo"><img src="/content/dam/bagic/aboutus/awards/innovation-emerging-technology-award.jpg"/></div>
                            	<div class="awardsInfobox">
                            		<div class="awardsTitle">Innovation &amp; Emerging Technology Award at Asia Insurance Technology Awards 2018</div>
                            		<div class="awardsDisc">Bajaj Allianz General Insurance has won the Innovation &amp; Emerging Technology Award for its Motor On The Spot (Motor OTS) initiative at the Asia Insurance Technology Awards 2018. The initiative allows our customers to make motor insurance claims up to INR 20,000 via our app and get them settled within half an hour. The award was received by Mr Sasikumar Adidamu, Chief Technical Officer and Mr AV Padmanabha, Vice President, Motor Claims at an award ceremony in Singapore.</div>
                            	</div>
                        	</div>
                    	</li>
               		
                    	<li>
                        	<div class="awardsImg"><img src="/content/dam/bagic/aboutus/awards/disruptor-of-the-year.jpg" alt="Award Won By BAGIC"/></div>
                        	<div class="awardsTitle">Disruptor of the Year by ET Now</div>
                        	<div class="awardsDisc">Bajaj Allianz General Insurance won the Disruptor of the Year Award by ET Now</div>
                        	<div class="awardsBtn"><a class="btn cyberLearnMore">Read more</a></div>
                        	<div class="hiddenAwardsInfo">
                            	<div class="awardsImgInfo"><img src="/content/dam/bagic/aboutus/awards/disruptor-of-the-year.jpg" alt="Award Won By BAGIC"/></div>
                            	<div class="awardsInfobox">
                            		<div class="awardsTitle">Disruptor of the Year by ET Now</div>
                            		<div class="awardsDisc">Bajaj Allianz General Insurance won the Disruptor of the Year Award by ET Now. The award celebrates organizations that are game-changers and re-define their own marketplace by setting new norms and innovation. Mr. Milind Choudhari, our Chief Financial Officer, &amp; Mr. Satish Kedia, Sr. Vice President, Corporate Marketing, received the award on behalf of the Company.</div>
                            	</div>
                        	</div>
                    	</li>
               		
                    	<li>
                        	<div class="awardsImg"><img src="/content/dam/bagic/aboutus/awards/most-trusted-global-brand-award.jpg"/></div>
                        	<div class="awardsTitle">Most Trusted Global Brand Award by Herald Global &amp; BARC Asia</div>
                        	<div class="awardsDisc">Bajaj Allianz General Insurance has been awarded The Most Trusted Global Brand 2018 by Herald Global &amp; BARC Asia</div>
                        	<div class="awardsBtn"><a class="btn cyberLearnMore">Read more</a></div>
                        	<div class="hiddenAwardsInfo">
                            	<div class="awardsImgInfo"><img src="/content/dam/bagic/aboutus/awards/most-trusted-global-brand-award.jpg"/></div>
                            	<div class="awardsInfobox">
                            		<div class="awardsTitle">Most Trusted Global Brand Award by Herald Global &amp; BARC Asia</div>
                            		<div class="awardsDisc">Bajaj Allianz General Insurance has been awarded The Most Trusted Global Brand 2018 by Herald Global &amp; BARC Asia. This award acknowledges the leading brand in its domain on the basis of its superlative performance, the heightened brand recall, loyalty amongst customer base and the values of trust and efficiency that the brand exudes.</div>
                            	</div>
                        	</div>
                    	</li>
               		
                    	<li>
                        	<div class="awardsImg"><img src="/content/dam/bagic/aboutus/awards/ACEF-HR-Summit-Awards.jpg"/></div>
                        	<div class="awardsTitle">Multiple wins at the ACEF HR Summit &amp; Awards for Excellence in HR</div>
                        	<div class="awardsDisc">Bajaj Allianz General Insurance bagged three awards at the ACEF HR Summit &amp; Awards for Excellence in HR 2018</div>
                        	<div class="awardsBtn"><a class="btn cyberLearnMore">Read more</a></div>
                        	<div class="hiddenAwardsInfo">
                            	<div class="awardsImgInfo"><img src="/content/dam/bagic/aboutus/awards/ACEF-HR-Summit-Awards.jpg"/></div>
                            	<div class="awardsInfobox">
                            		<div class="awardsTitle">Multiple wins at the ACEF HR Summit &amp; Awards for Excellence in HR</div>
                            		<div class="awardsDisc">Bajaj Allianz General Insurance bagged three awards at the ACEF HR Summit &amp; Awards for Excellence in HR 2018. At the premier awards, we won Gold for Most Effective Recruitment Strategy and two Bronzes for Best Learning &amp; Development Strategy and Best Employee Engagement Strategy. The ceremony also honoured Mr. Vikramjeet Singh, our Chief Human Resources Officer, with Silver for Leader of the Year award. The ACEF Awards recognize and celebrate the best practices in the field of Human Resources amongst various corporations in India.

</div>
                            	</div>
                        	</div>
                    	</li>
               		
                    	<li>
                        	<div class="awardsImg"><img src="/content/dam/bagic/aboutus/awards/digital-insurer-of-the-year-2018.jpg"/></div>
                        	<div class="awardsTitle">Digital Insurer of the Year 2018 at Asia Insurance Industry Awards</div>
                        	<div class="awardsDisc">Bajaj Allianz General Insurance reinstated its technological prowess by echoing its 2017 victory in the Digital Insurer of the Year</div>
                        	<div class="awardsBtn"><a class="btn cyberLearnMore">Read more</a></div>
                        	<div class="hiddenAwardsInfo">
                            	<div class="awardsImgInfo"><img src="/content/dam/bagic/aboutus/awards/digital-insurer-of-the-year-2018.jpg"/></div>
                            	<div class="awardsInfobox">
                            		<div class="awardsTitle">Digital Insurer of the Year 2018 at Asia Insurance Industry Awards</div>
                            		<div class="awardsDisc">Bajaj Allianz General Insurance reinstated its technological prowess by echoing its 2017 victory in the Digital Insurer of the Year category at the prestigious 22nd Asia Insurance Industry Awards 2018. The award was received by Mr Sourabh Chatterjee, President &amp; Head - IT, Direct Marketing, Web Sales &amp; Travel at a glittering award ceremony in Singapore.</div>
                            	</div>
                        	</div>
                    	</li>
               		
                    	<li>
                        	<div class="awardsImg"><img src="/content/dam/bagic/aboutus/awards/personality-of-the-year-award-2018.jpg"/></div>
                        	<div class="awardsTitle">Personality of the Year 2018 at Asia Insurance Industry Awards</div>
                        	<div class="awardsDisc">Tapan Singhel, our MD &amp; CEO has been honoured with the Personality of The Year Award at the prestigious 22nd Asia Insurance Industry Awards 2018</div>
                        	<div class="awardsBtn"><a class="btn cyberLearnMore">Read more</a></div>
                        	<div class="hiddenAwardsInfo">
                            	<div class="awardsImgInfo"><img src="/content/dam/bagic/aboutus/awards/personality-of-the-year-award-2018.jpg"/></div>
                            	<div class="awardsInfobox">
                            		<div class="awardsTitle">Personality of the Year 2018 at Asia Insurance Industry Awards</div>
                            		<div class="awardsDisc">Tapan Singhel, our MD &amp; CEO has been honoured with the Personality of The Year Award at the prestigious 22nd Asia Insurance Industry Awards 2018. The award underscores his strong business acumen, leadership skills and commitment to driving strong business growth. Believing that people are the heartbeat of every workplace and society, our MD &amp; CEO has also set the tone from the top by championing employee-centric policies and voluntary community work throughout the company.</div>
                            	</div>
                        	</div>
                    	</li>
               		
                    	<li>
                        	<div class="awardsImg"><img src="/content/dam/bagic/aboutus/awards/LinkedIn-top-voices-2018.jpg"/></div>
                        	<div class="awardsTitle">Tapan Singhel featured as one of the top voices in LinkedIn Top Voices 2018 List for India</div>
                        	<div class="awardsDisc">Leading professional networking platform, LinkedIn features Mr Tapan Singhel, MD &amp; CEO, Bajaj Allianz General Insurance in the LinkedIn Top Voices 2018 list for India</div>
                        	<div class="awardsBtn"><a class="btn cyberLearnMore">Read more</a></div>
                        	<div class="hiddenAwardsInfo">
                            	<div class="awardsImgInfo"><img src="/content/dam/bagic/aboutus/awards/LinkedIn-top-voices-2018.jpg"/></div>
                            	<div class="awardsInfobox">
                            		<div class="awardsTitle">Tapan Singhel featured as one of the top voices in LinkedIn Top Voices 2018 List for India</div>
                            		<div class="awardsDisc">Leading professional networking platform, LinkedIn features Mr Tapan Singhel, MD &amp; CEO, Bajaj Allianz General Insurance in the LinkedIn Top Voices 2018 list for India. The annual list highlights professionals from India who have driven engaging conversations in their respective industries by sharing unique insights, and sparking conversations that have informed everyone</div>
                            	</div>
                        	</div>
                    	</li>
               		
                    	<li>
                        	<div class="awardsImg"><img src="/content/dam/bagic/aboutus/awards/Dale-Carnegie-Global-Leadership-Award-2018.jpg"/></div>
                        	<div class="awardsTitle">L&amp;D Team wins prestigious Dale Carnegie Global Leadership Award</div>
                        	<div class="awardsDisc">The Learning &amp; Development team of Bajaj Allianz General Insurance has added yet another feather to its cap by winning the prestigious annual honor - The Dale Carnegie Global Leadership Award 2018.</div>
                        	<div class="awardsBtn"><a class="btn cyberLearnMore">Read more</a></div>
                        	<div class="hiddenAwardsInfo">
                            	<div class="awardsImgInfo"><img src="/content/dam/bagic/aboutus/awards/Dale-Carnegie-Global-Leadership-Award-2018.jpg"/></div>
                            	<div class="awardsInfobox">
                            		<div class="awardsTitle">L&amp;D Team wins prestigious Dale Carnegie Global Leadership Award</div>
                            		<div class="awardsDisc">The Learning &amp; Development team of Bajaj Allianz General Insurance has added yet another feather to its cap by winning the prestigious annual honor - The Dale Carnegie Global Leadership Award 2018. The award created by Dale Carnegie &amp; Associates recognizes companies who prioritize their employee&#39;s development and showcase this belief through their investments in people development. In this year&#39;s edition of the awards, applications had come in from 45&#43; companies across sectors and the winner was selected by an International jury. Innovation, relevance and strong linkage of L&amp;D strategy with business goals were the major evaluation criteria and Bajaj Allianz General Insurance left behind big names like Infosys BPM, CISCO, Hindustan Petroleum, L&amp;T etc. to win the honor, in a sparkling ceremony held at Taj Lands End Mumbai. The award was received by Ganesh Nair - Head, L&amp;D, Priyam Chandiramani- Manager, L&amp;D, Anuradha Kamath - Deputy Manager-L&amp;D and Aneri Vyas - Senior Executive- L&amp;D.

</div>
                            	</div>
                        	</div>
                    	</li>
               		
                    	<li>
                        	<div class="awardsImg"><img src="/content/dam/bagic/aboutus/awards/Dun-Bradstreet-BFSI-Summit-2019.jpg"/></div>
                        	<div class="awardsTitle">Dun &amp; Bradstreet honours Bajaj Allianz General Insurance as India&#39;s Leading General Insurance Company 2019 - Private</div>
                        	<div class="awardsDisc">Dun &amp; Bradstreet, the global leader in commercial data and analytics, has honoured Bajaj Allianz General </div>
                        	<div class="awardsBtn"><a class="btn cyberLearnMore">Read more</a></div>
                        	<div class="hiddenAwardsInfo">
                            	<div class="awardsImgInfo"><img src="/content/dam/bagic/aboutus/awards/Dun-Bradstreet-BFSI-Summit-2019.jpg"/></div>
                            	<div class="awardsInfobox">
                            		<div class="awardsTitle">Dun &amp; Bradstreet honours Bajaj Allianz General Insurance as India&#39;s Leading General Insurance Company 2019 - Private</div>
                            		<div class="awardsDisc">Dun &amp; Bradstreet, the global leader in commercial data and analytics, has honoured Bajaj Allianz General Insurance as winner in the category of India&#39;s Leading General Insurance Company - Private at the Dun &amp; Bradstreet BFSI Summit 2019. The Dun &amp; Bradstreet (D&amp;B) award highlights the exemplary performance of company. On behalf of the organisation, Mr KV Dipu, President &amp; Head, Operations; Mr Chetan Prakash, Sr. Vice President &amp; Head, Other products received the award at gala award ceremony in Mumbai.</div>
                            	</div>
                        	</div>
                    	</li>
               		
                    	<li>
                        	<div class="awardsImg"><img src="/content/dam/bagic/aboutus/awards/marketer-of-the-year-2019.jpg" alt="BAGIC"/></div>
                        	<div class="awardsTitle">Bajaj Allianz General Insurance Wins Marketer of the Year Award at The Insurance India Summit &amp; Awards 2019</div>
                        	<div class="awardsDisc">The India Insurance Summit &amp; Awards 2019 recognised Bajaj Allianz General Insurance as the Marketer of the Year for its Claims on Wheels</div>
                        	<div class="awardsBtn"><a class="btn cyberLearnMore">Read more</a></div>
                        	<div class="hiddenAwardsInfo">
                            	<div class="awardsImgInfo"><img src="/content/dam/bagic/aboutus/awards/marketer-of-the-year-2019.jpg" alt="BAGIC"/></div>
                            	<div class="awardsInfobox">
                            		<div class="awardsTitle">Bajaj Allianz General Insurance Wins Marketer of the Year Award at The Insurance India Summit &amp; Awards 2019</div>
                            		<div class="awardsDisc">The India Insurance Summit &amp; Awards 2019 recognised Bajaj Allianz General Insurance as the Marketer of the Year for its Claims on Wheels initiative launched jointly with Operations team during the devastating Kerala floods. The award was received by Ms Monica Mayur, Head, Brand Communications at glittering award ceremony held Mumbai.

</div>
                            	</div>
                        	</div>
                    	</li>
               		
                    	<li>
                        	<div class="awardsImg"><img src="/content/dam/bagic/aboutus/awards/indian-insurance-summit-awards-2019.jpg" alt="eight"/></div>
                        	<div class="awardsTitle">The Insurance India Summit &amp; Awards 2019 honours Mr Tapan Singhel, MD &amp; CEO</div>
                        	<div class="awardsDisc">The prestigious Indian Insurance Summit &amp; Awards 2019 honoured Mr Tapan Singhel, MD &amp; CEO, Bajaj Allianz General Insurance with the Personality of the Year award.</div>
                        	<div class="awardsBtn"><a class="btn cyberLearnMore">Read more</a></div>
                        	<div class="hiddenAwardsInfo">
                            	<div class="awardsImgInfo"><img src="/content/dam/bagic/aboutus/awards/indian-insurance-summit-awards-2019.jpg" alt="eight"/></div>
                            	<div class="awardsInfobox">
                            		<div class="awardsTitle">The Insurance India Summit &amp; Awards 2019 honours Mr Tapan Singhel, MD &amp; CEO</div>
                            		<div class="awardsDisc">The prestigious Indian Insurance Summit &amp; Awards 2019 honoured Mr Tapan Singhel, MD &amp; CEO, Bajaj Allianz General Insurance with the Personality of the Year award. The annual event celebrates innovative and strategic vision of leaders across the insurance sector. The award was received by Mr Tapan Singhel at a glittering award ceremony in Mumbai.</div>
                            	</div>
                        	</div>
                    	</li>
               		
                    	<li>
                        	<div class="awardsImg"><img src="/content/dam/bagic/aboutus/awards/Money_Today.jpg" alt="seven"/></div>
                        	<div class="awardsTitle">Bajaj Allianz General Insurance wins prestigious Money Today Award for the Best Motor Insurance Provider of the Year</div>
                        	<div class="awardsDisc">The prestigious Money Today Awards honoured Bajaj Allianz General Insurance with the Best Motor Insurance Provider of the Year award.</div>
                        	<div class="awardsBtn"><a class="btn cyberLearnMore">Read more</a></div>
                        	<div class="hiddenAwardsInfo">
                            	<div class="awardsImgInfo"><img src="/content/dam/bagic/aboutus/awards/Money_Today.jpg" alt="seven"/></div>
                            	<div class="awardsInfobox">
                            		<div class="awardsTitle">Bajaj Allianz General Insurance wins prestigious Money Today Award for the Best Motor Insurance Provider of the Year</div>
                            		<div class="awardsDisc">The prestigious Money Today Awards honoured Bajaj Allianz General Insurance with the Best Motor Insurance Provider of the Year award. The award was received by Gurneesh Khurana, Head - Motor Business and KSVVS Murthy Naidu, Head, Products.</div>
                            	</div>
                        	</div>
                    	</li>
               		
                    	<li>
